  "rootReview": "Independently verified21 candidates/baselines/diffs and the three approved parent/composition reviews. All nine Root-reviewed Native methods and the new V2 Native method retain byte-identical function bodies; the changed Fixture uses the existing App owner and process-scoped JVM. Checked58 ported production hashes,127 actual JVM compilation inputs (one explicit validation-only heap stanza), exact8 XML method identities/zero failures,346 actual compiled JAR class byte bindings and embedded manifest/CRC. Existing JVM/Java/packaging results are reused at exact hashes, not repeated or promoted to Swift/SDK/JNI acceptance. V2 original parser, exact GSON marker admission, checked login-before-close, transient session/state projection, nullable select slots and owned rapid-source/close drainage are connected in the actual same View. Root credential owner now records an accepted irreversible commit before synchronous revision notifications can cancel its caller.",
  "fixedReviewFindings": [
    "Existing exhaustive Swift operation switch omitted new V2 cases.",
